==Battleground==
*1 [[Zang Roo]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*1 [[Shadow Boxer K]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Scissoroo]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Doctor K.O.]] spawns after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns as the boss.
**12 [[Doctor K.O.]]s spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 4.67~6 seconds<sup>140f~180f</sup>.
**18 [[Scissoroo]]s spawn after 1.67 seconds<sup>50f</sup>, delay 6.67~9.33 seconds<sup>200f~280f</sup>.
**12 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10~11.33 seconds<sup>300f~340f</sup>.
**2 [[Zang Roo]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
**1 [[Zang Roo]] spawns after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is just a raw DPS check. So go all-out with your most powerful units, preferably cheap and strong area attackers. You could also use [[Talents|Talented]] [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] to burst them down much faster.

If you are struggling with the burrowing Zang Roos, Bring Holy Blast to prevent them from ruining your stack.

