==Trivia==
*Sprint Parade's Japanese name, Tankyori Parade (短距離パレード, "Short-distance Parade"), refers to how all the enemies in the stage have short range.
*[[Ms. Madonna]] is the only variant of [[Kang Roo]] not to appear in Sprint Parade.

